{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55357","headline":"白牛颂 · 匡山和尚","name":"白牛颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有古坛真白牛，父子藏来经几秋。\n出门直透孤峰顶，回来暂跨虎谿头。\n（均见《景德传灯录》卷二十三、《五灯会元》卷八。\n）（按：贯休有《寄匡山大愿和尚诗》，未知与匡山和尚是一人否。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"匡山和尚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}